{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into <i>Helrift</i>, a gritty MMORPG where ancient rivalries collide and every player\u2019s journey shapes the fate of a realm. With old-school intensity blended with modern visuals, <i>Helrift</i> offers a world where only the strongest survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Allegiance</strong>: Take up arms for one of two warring factions, each with unique history and purpose. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Faction Warfare: </strong>Engage in tactical PvP battles across contested zones. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World of Conflict:</strong> Explore, fight, and carve your path through the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Your Build:</strong> Stats define your combat style, from wielding powerful magic to donning heavy armor.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Economy: </strong>Create, find, buy and sell items as a crafter, merchant, or warrior seeking the best gear.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Helrift</i>, legends are not born - they\u2019re made. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3312590?t=1768575438","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312590/fa93577bcec51a8816d4f901167404e7faf3e569/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768575438","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312590/3481dceaf6fd409cfa9492a0526ecb5d60b6f1b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768575438","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312590/3481dceaf6fd409cfa9492a0526ecb5d60b6f1b1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768575438","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP",